Source: crc32-v2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mahmoud Harmouch <oss@wiseai.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/wiseaidev/crc32-v2

Package: crc32-v2
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Blazingly fast CRC-32 Rust library with slicing-by-16
 crc32-v2 provides a pure-software, 100%-safe-Rust CRC-32 implementation
 using slicing-by-16 tables for maximum throughput (~1.3 GiB/s), with
 zero heap allocation in the hot path. Includes Python and Node.js
 native bindings via maturin/napi-rs.
